  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Sir_Squilliam_V.2C_Esq.\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sir_Squilliam_V,_Esq.\">Sir Squilliam V, Esq.</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item currently cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a> and probably should be able to be.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #B1D3A0 solid; margin: 4px; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:var(--background-color-disabled-subtle, #D3D3D3);\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">30\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"13\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"width: 425px; background-color: #D3D3D3;\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/File:Salt_Shot_icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Salt_Shot_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br /><a href=\"/page/Salt_Shot\" title=\"Salt Shot\">Salt Shot</a>\n<table class=\"fakeClass\" style=\"width: 420px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Target:</th><td>Foe, Directional, Breakable</td></tr>\n<tr><th>School:</th><td>Evocation</td></tr><tr><th>Spell Resistance:</th><td>No</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Description:</th><td>Fires a lance of Salt at enemies. At higher charge level multiple knives are rapidly fired. Opponents struck by the knives receive a Reflex save for half damage.</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">&#160;</th></tr>\n<tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier I:</th><td>4 to 14 &#8203; + 1 to 2 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier II:</th><td>5 to 19 &#8203; + 1 to 4 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier III:</th><td>6 to 24 &#8203; + 1 to 6 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier IV:</th><td>7 to 29 &#8203; + 1 to 8 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier V:</th><td>8 to 34 &#8203; + 1 to 10 per Artificer Level</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Use\" title=\"Rune Arm Use\">Artificer Rune Arm Use</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">440 / 440\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10p